WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.569
We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.538
And now we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.573
President Biden said on Friday

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:09.809
that Russia would pay
"a severe price"

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.078
if they used
chemical weapons in Ukraine.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:15.482
A severe price,
or as it's now known, "premium."

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:17.716
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:19.585
President Biden spoke on Friday

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:22.254
with Ukrainian
President Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:23.857
for nearly 50 minutes.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.626
Zelenskyy asked for more
sanctions against Russia,

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:31.097
like maybe call Putin and keep
him on the phone for 50 minutes.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.598
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:35.668
The head of Russia's
National Guard said yesterday

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.404
that the invasion of Ukraine
has been slower than expected.

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.241
Oh, interesting. I wonder
what his replacement will say.

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:42.442
"Things are right on track!"

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:45.544
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:47.079
President Biden on Friday

00:00:47.079 --> 00:00:48.514
urged House Democrats

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:50.383
to talk up
the party's accomplishments

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.951
going into midterm elections.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:55.989
Said Democrats, "Um,
we got Pelosi's lectern back?"

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.324
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.492
United Airlines
announced last week

00:01:00.492 --> 00:01:03.162
that employees
who were placed on unpaid leave

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:04.931
for refusing to get vaccinated

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.532
can return to work
later this month.

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:09.368
So don't worry, your pilot
might be unvaccinated,

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:11.571
but at least
he's also out of practice.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.274
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.609
A Florida man
was arrested last week

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.778
after he allegedly
called the police

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:22.148
and asked them to test
the crystal meth he'd purchased

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.784
to ensure it was authentic.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.152
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:29.689
Said the man,
"So is that a yes?"

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.458
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:34.727
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.129
"I get one phone call?

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:38.164
I got great news, Scootch!"

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.666
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.704
During a recent episode
of the competition show

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:46.005
"The Masked Singer,"

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.341
a contestant accidentally
knocked their mask off.

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.075
Luckily, since it was
"The Masked Singer,"

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:51.945
the judges
still didn't know who it was.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.946
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:56.182
"Oh, the guy from the thing."

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:58.584
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:01.587
Actor Jussie Smollett
was sentenced to five months

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:04.190
in a Chicago jail last week
for staging a hate crime.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.658
Here's what you do, Jussie.

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:08.127
First day in the joint, walk up
to the biggest guy in there

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:10.363
and say, "Act like
you're beating me up."

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.732
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:15.735
"It never doesn't work."

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:18.504
According to a new poll,
Seattle is the most desirable

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:20.673
post-graduation city
for college students.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:24.544
That story again -- Gen Z just
discovered "Frasier" on Peacock.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.913
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.647 --> 00:02:29.915
That story, again --

00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:33.086
Karen, our writer Karen,
just discovered "Frasier."

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:35.688
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.457
And finally, a man in Florida --

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:39.559
by the way, I had to
separate our Florida jokes.

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:40.960
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.896
We're just going to act
like this is the first one

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:46.566
when we all remember the crystal
meth guy a few jokes back.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:47.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.970
[ Chuckles ]
That guy went first.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.238
When we ordered them,
we were like,

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:55.407
"That one, I think
we can put him early."

00:02:55.407 --> 00:02:57.644
And finally, a man in Florida
was arrested last week

00:02:57.644 --> 00:02:59.879
after he was
allegedly caught masturbating

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:01.780
in a Miami Beach Starbucks.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.883
Employees suspected
the man was unhinged

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:07.020
the moment he ordered a
Starbucks breakfast sandwich.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.522
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.992
In the end,
it was a joke about Starbucks.

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.126
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:15.562
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

